<model version="5.1.3" links="0">
 <documentation>Blinky for RP2040 boards on the Earle Philhower arduino-pico core, using the QP/C++ 7.3.4 QV kernel from qp-arduino. The &quot;LED&quot; is LED_BUILTIN (GP25 on a Raspberry Pi Pico) unless QP_ARDUINO_LED_PIN says otherwise, and QP_ARDUINO_TICK_PROBE_PIN optionally pulses a GPIO from the tick callback for a logic analyzer. See examples/blinky_bsp-rp2040/README.md.</documentation>
